{"ticker":"SPG","updated":"2026-11-07T01:54:51Z","profile":{"longName":"Simon Property Group, Inc.","shortName":"Simon Property Group, Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","country":"United States","website":"https://www.simon.com","fullTimeEmployees":3100,"marketCap":86713597952,"trailingPE":16.492418,"forwardPE":33.723442,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":12.121488,"pegRatio":4.58,"targetMeanPrice":228.89474,"targetHighPrice":275.0,"targetLowPrice":205.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.133,"earningsGrowth":-0.171,"grossMargins":0.81308,"operatingMargins":0.44333,"profitMargins":0.6309,"totalRevenue":7153709056,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":238.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":177.88,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.93},"summary":"Simon Property Group, Inc. is a self-administered and self-managed real estate investment trust (REIT). Simon Property Group, L.P., or the Operating Partnership, is our majority-owned partnership subsidiary that owns all of our real estate properties and other assets. In this package, the terms Simon, we, our, or the Company refer to Simon Property Group, Inc., the Operating Partnership, and its subsidiaries. We own, develop and manage premier shopping, dining, entertainment and mixed-use destinations, which consist primarily of malls, Premium Outlets, The Mills, and International Properties. At December 31, 2024, we owned or had an interest in 229 properties comprising 183 million square feet in North America, Asia and Europe. We also owned an 88% interest in The Taubman Realty Group, or TRG, which owns 22 regional, super-regional, and outlet malls in the U.S. and Asia. Additionally, at December 31, 2024, we had a 22.4% ownership interest in Klepierre, a publicly traded, Paris-based real estate company, which owns shopping centers in 14 European countries. Simon Property Group, Inc. was incorporated in 1960 and is based in Indianapolis, Indiana.","summary_zh":"西蒙地產集團有限公司 (Simon Property Group, Inc.) 是一家自我管理和自我管理的房地產投資信託基金 (REIT)。 Simon Property Group, L.P.（或稱營運合夥企業）是我們擁有多數股權的合夥子公司，擁有我們所有的房地產和其他資產。在本文件中，術語「西蒙」、「我們」、「我們的」或「公司」是指 Simon Property Group, Inc.、營運合夥企業及其子公司。我們擁有、開發和管理一流的購物、餐飲、娛樂和綜合用途目的地，其中主要包括購物中心、名牌折扣購物中心、The Mills 和國際房地產。截至 2024 年 12 月 31 日，我們在北美、亞洲和歐洲擁有 229 處房產或擁有權益，總面積達 1.83 億平方英尺。我們還擁有 Taubman Realty Group (TRG) 88% 的股權，該集團在美國和亞洲擁有 22 家區域、超區域和直銷購物中心。此外，截至 2024 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有 Klepierre 22.4% 的所有權權益，Klepierre 是一家總部位於巴黎的上市房地產公司，在 14 個歐洲國家擁有購物中心。 Simon Property Group, Inc. 成立於 1960 年，總部位於印第安納州印第安納波利斯。","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產投資信託基金 - 零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":181.77,"h":182.93,"l":180.11,"c":182.55,"v":2369300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":179.45,"h":180.38,"l":178.15,"c":179.39,"v":1889400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":178.91,"h":179.87,"l":177.99,"c":179.23,"v":2223300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":179.99,"h":184.16,"l":179.66,"c":183.9,"v":1786300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":183.9,"h":184.5,"l":182.1,"c":182.47,"v":1547300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":182.21,"h":184.24,"l":181.25,"c":183.76,"v":1570800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":183.28,"h":184.07,"l":181.25,"c":181.52,"v":1348600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":181.54,"h":184.15,"l":180.67,"c":181.56,"v":1706300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":182.0,"h":182.84,"l":178.68,"c":180.09,"v":1898600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":180.36,"h":182.31,"l":180.04,"c":180.72,"v":7083300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":179.74,"h":181.43,"l":178.39,"c":181.14,"v":1401800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":180.72,"h":184.67,"l":180.62,"c":184.13,"v":1386200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":184.07,"h":184.68,"l":182.48,"c":183.13,"v":1531200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":183.09,"h":183.78,"l":182.48,"c":182.61,"v":1303600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":182.82,"h":185.88,"l":182.22,"c":185.39,"v":1368100},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":185.47,"h":186.34,"l":184.82,"c":185.85,"v":1282600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":186.17,"h":188.14,"l":185.3,"c":187.67,"v":1812200},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":187.66,"h":188.43,"l":184.4,"c":185.76,"v":1836400},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":185.